message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "5-Level Cascaded H-Bridge Inverter with STM32 Nucleo-F303RE"
abstract: >-
  Modular cascaded H-bridge multilevel inverter built around two identical
  single-bridge PCB modules driven by phase-shifted carrier PWM on an
  STM32 Nucleo-F303RE. Includes a PySide6 operator dashboard, bit-banged
  MCP3201 isolated sensing, and a complete bring-up and design-decision
  record. Graduation project, Hacettepe University EEE, 2026.
